> ↗</span></span></a>\n        <a class=\"nt\" href=\"/free_builder/window-radio/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"--glow:#F0B13A\"><span class=\"nt-shot\"><img src=\"/after-hours/window-radio.webp?v=19aa10fd\" width=\"480\" height=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\"></span><span class=\"nt-txt\"><span class=\"nt-n\">12</span><b><span data-i18n=\"wrName\">Window Radio</span></b><span class=\"nt-l\" data-i18n=\"wrL\">Lo-fi from your window. The day writes the tape.</span><span class=\"nt-go\"><span data-i18n=\"wrGo\">Open Window Radio</span> ↗</span></span></a>\n        <a class=\"nt\" href=\"/free_builder/get-well-soup/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"--glow:#E2654A\"><span class=\"nt-shot\"><img src=\"/after-hours/get-well-soup.webp?v=234dbfa1\" width=\"480\" height=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\"></span><span class=\"nt-txt\"><span class=\"nt-n\">13</span><b><span data-i18n=\"gwName\">Get Well Soup</span></b><span class=\"nt-l\" data-i18n=\"gwL\">Someone's got a cold? Put a pot on for them.</span><span class=\"nt-go\"><span data-i18n=\"gwGo\">Open Get Well Soup</span> ↗</span></span></a>\n        <a class=\"nt\" href=\"/free_builder/cook-for-someone/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"--glow:#E8A838\"><span class=\"nt-shot\"><img src=\"/after-hours/cook-for-someone.webp?v=8a3390ce\" width=\"480\" height=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\"></span><span class=\"nt-txt\"><span class=\"nt-n\">14</span><b><span data-i18n=\"cfName\">Cook for Someone</span></b><span class=\"nt-l\" data-i18n=\"cfL\">Popo's recipe box, for whoever's eating.</span><span class=\"nt-go\"><span data-i18n=\"cfGo\">Open Cook for Someone</span> ↗</span></span></a>\n        <a class=\"nt\" href=\"/free_builder/mix-for-someone/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"--glow:#E3B764\"><span class=\"nt-shot\"><img src=\"/after-hours/mix-for-someone.webp?v=383f558a\" width=\"480\" height=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\"