for Someone</span> ↗</span></span></a>\n        <a class=\"nt\" href=\"/free_builder/steep-for-someone/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"--glow:#8A3A24\"><span class=\"nt-shot\"><img src=\"/after-hours/steep-for-someone.webp?v=16f9960a\" width=\"480\" height=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\"></span><span class=\"nt-txt\"><span class=\"nt-n\">19</span><b><span data-i18n=\"tfName\">Steep for Someone</span></b><span class=\"nt-l\" data-i18n=\"tfL\">Tea from the tables of the world, poured at Popo's. The other cup is for someone.</span><span class=\"nt-go\"><span data-i18n=\"tfGo\">Open Steep for Someone</span> ↗</span></span></a>\n        <a class=\"nt\" href=\"/free_builder/casino/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"--glow:#C8303A\"><span class=\"nt-shot\"><img src=\"/after-hours/casino.webp?v=2b914f6d\" width=\"480\" height=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\"></span><span class=\"nt-txt\"><span class=\"nt-n\">20</span><b><span data-i18n=\"acName\">After Hours Casino</span></b><span class=\"nt-l\" data-i18n=\"acL\">A tiny casino for one table. Seeds for chips, never money.</span><span class=\"nt-go\"><span data-i18n=\"acGo\">Open After Hours Casino</span> ↗</span></span></a>\n        <a class=\"nt\" href=\"/free_builder/still-today/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"--glow:#F6B73C\"><span class=\"nt-shot\"><img src=\"/after-hours/still-today.webp?v=9349548d\" width=\"480\" height=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\"></span><span class=\"nt-txt\"><span class=\"nt-n\">21</span><b><span data-i18n=\"slName\">Still Today</span></b><span class=\"nt-l\" data-i18n=\"slL\">Pretend today was your last day. Good news: it isn't.</span><span class=\"nt-go\"><span data-i18n=\"slGo\">Open Still Today</span> ↗</span></span></a>\n        <a class=\"nt\" href=\"/free_builder/what-grows-between-us/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"--glow:#6AB04A\"><span class=\"nt-shot\"><img src=\"/after-hours/what-grows-between-us.webp?v=2a8e1658\" width=\"480\" height=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\"></span><span class=\"nt-txt\"><span class=\"nt-n\">22</span><b><span data-i18n=\"gbName\">What Grows Between Us</span></b><span class=\"nt-l\" data-i18n=\"gbL\">A seed with no label, grown by your friends from what you do together.</span><span class=\"nt-go\"><span data-i18n=\"gbGo\">Open What Grows Between Us</span> ↗</span></span></a>\n        <a class=\"nt\" href=\"/free_builder/counting-sleeps/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"--glow:#C8412F\"><span class=\"nt-shot\"><img src=\"/after-hours/counting-sleeps.webp?v=80a3e958\" width=\"480\" height=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\"></span><span class=\"nt-txt\"><span class=\"nt-n\">23</span><b><span data-i18n=\"csName\">Counting Sleeps</span></b><span class=\"nt-l\" data-i18n=\"csL\">The day you'll see them, counted on a paper chain.</span><span class=\"nt-go\"><span data-i18n=\"csGo\">Open Counting Sleeps</span> ↗</span></span></a>\n        <a class=\"nt\" href=\"/free_builder/nearby/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"--glow:#8E7FE6\"><span class=\"nt-shot\"><img src=\"/after-hours/nearby.webp?v=369e0268\" width=\"480\" height=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\"></span><span class=\"nt-txt\"><span class=\"nt-n\">24</span><b>Nearby</b><span class=\"nt-l\" data-i18n=\"nbL\">A little world that sends you back to yours.</span><span class=\"nt-go\"><span data-i18n=\"nbGo\">Walk in</span> ↗</span></span></a>\n        <a class=\"nt\" href=\"/free_builder/station/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"--glow:#6F93D8\"><span class=\"nt-shot\"><img src=\"/after-hours/station.webp?v=774e227c\" width=\"480\" height=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\"></span><span class=\"nt-txt\"><span class=\"nt-n\">25</span><b><span data-i18n=\"stName\">Nearby Station</span></b><span class=\"nt-l\" data-i18n=\"stL\">A window seat on a slow train.</span><span class=\"nt-go\"><span data-i18n=\"stGo\">Board</span> ↗</span></span></a>\n        <a class=\"nt\" href=\"/free_builder/handoff/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"--glow:#E9825E\"><span class=\"nt-shot\"><img src=\"/after-hours/handoff.webp?v=d103c7ed\" width=\"480\" height=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\"></span><span class=\"nt-txt\"><span class=\"nt-n\">26</span><b>Handoff</b><span class=\"nt-l\" data-i18n=\"hoL\">For two people in different cities.</span><span class=\"nt-go\"><span data-i18n=\"hoGo\">Open Handoff</span> ↗</span></span></a>\n        <a class=\"nt\" href=\"/free_builder/two-candles/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"--glow:#F2B54A\"><span class=\"nt-shot\"><img src=\"/after-hours/two-candles.webp?v=88fb2445\" width=\"480\" height=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\"></span><span class=\"nt-txt\"><span class=\"nt-n\">27</span><b><span data-i18n=\"tcName\">Two Candles</span></b><span class=\"nt-l\" data-i18n=\"tcL\">Dinner for two, however far apart.</span><span class=\"nt-go\"><span data-i18n=\"tcGo\">Book a table</span> ↗</span></span></a>\n        <a class=\"nt\" href=\"/free_builder/vocab/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"--glow:#7FC9B8\"><span class=\"nt-shot\"><img src=\"/after-hours/vocab.webp?v=526a414d\" width=\"480\" height=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\"></span><span class=\"nt-txt\"><span class=\"nt-n\">28</span><b>Vocab</b><span class=\"nt-l\" data-i18n=\"voL\">A few words in someone else's language.</span><span class=\"nt-go\"><span data-i18n=\"voGo\">Open Vocab</span> ↗</span></span></a>", "t": {"en": {"ppL": "Not here. Just think of one name.", "nbL": "A little world that sends you back to yours.", "nbGo": "Walk in", "ltL": "One small offline thing at a time.", "ltGo": "Open the jar", "fsL": "A few flowers, for someone real.", "fsGo": "Tie a bouquet", "pwL": "One card a day, from two cats.", "pwGo": "Ask for a card", "hoL": "For two people in different cities.", "hoGo": "Open Handoff", "voL": "A few words in